      "value": "What world is that? I've noticed that some of the newer SDK versions have updated quest shaders. But the worlds I've been looking at, have it fixed between avatar SDK versions 2022.06.03 and 3.1.13 (2023.03.31)\n\nI have a suspicion that on PC the more recent Quest shaders are treated as references, and for the older SDK, the shader used is the one that shipped with SDK\n\nSo I'd like to look at another location.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
